Task 2: Configure apk package manager.  
Description Task 2: If the package manager is apk, update the package cache without marking the task as changed, then upgrade all software and notify to reboot.

Task 3: Configure apt package manager.  
Description Task 3: If the package manager is apt, hold selected packages from upgrading, update and upgrade all software with specific environment settings, and perform autoremove if specified, each notifying to reboot.

Task 4: Update all software using dnf package manager.  
Description Task 4: If the package manager is dnf or dnf5, update all software to the latest state, excluding specified packages, and notify to reboot.

Task 5: Update all software using pacman package manager.  
Description Task 5: If the package manager is pacman, update the package cache and upgrade all software, notifying to reboot.

Task 6: Configure yum package manager.  
Description Task 6: If the package manager is yum, for version 6, update all software to the latest state and notify to reboot; for other versions, perform the same update and also install yum-utils.

Task 7: Update all software using zypper package manager.  
Description Task 7: If the package manager is zypper, update all software to the latest state and notify to reboot.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Task 1: Import the assert.yml file to be executed once on the localhost
  import_tasks: assert.yml
  delegate_to: localhost
  changed_when: false

- name: Task 2: Configure apk package manager
  apk:
    state: update
  changed_when: false
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr == 'apk'

- name: Task 3: Configure apt package manager
  apt:
    state: update
    hold_selected: yes
    environment:
      DEBIAN_FRONTEND: noninteractive
    autoremove: yes
  notify: Reboot the system
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr == 'apt'

- name: Task 4: Update all software using dnf package manager
  dnf:
    state: latest
    exclude: '{{ exclude_packages | default([]) }}'
  notify: Reboot the system
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr in ['dnf', 'dnf5']

- name: Task 5: Update all software using pacman package manager
  pacman:
    state: update
  notify: Reboot the system
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr == 'pacman'

- name: Task 6: Configure yum package manager
  yum:
    state: latest
  notify: Reboot the system
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr == 'yum' and ansible_distribution_version|int == 6
  register: yum_result
  changed_when: false
  async: 0
  ignore_errors: yes

- name: Task 6: Install yum-utils for older versions
  yum:
    name: yum-utils
    state: present
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr == 'yum' and ansible_distribution_version|int != 6
  changed_when: false
  async: 0
  ignore_errors: yes

- name: Task 7: Update all software using zypper package manager
  zypper:
    state: update
  notify: Reboot the system
  when: ansible_pkg_mgr == 'zypper'


