's necessary. The YAML structure should be clean, with proper indentation.\n\nLet me outline the structure:\n\n- Start with \'---\'\n- Then, the first task: enabling modules, using \'apache2_module\', \'when\' condition for Debian and Suse.\n- Second task: using \'template\' module, looping over \'httpd_locations\', setting the correct destination and permissions, and notifying the handlers.\n\nI should check if the variables like \'httpd_locations\' and the template path are correctly referenced. Also, ensure that the file mode is set properly to \'0644\'.\n\nI think that\'s all. Now, I\'ll write the YAML accordingly, making sure each task is correctly formatted and follows the instructions precisely.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Enable Apache2 modules\n  ansible.apache.apache2_module:\n    name: "{{ item }}"\n    state: enabled\n  loop:\n    - proxy\n    - proxy_http\n  when: ansible_distribution_family in [\'debian\', \'suse\']\n\n- name: Configure Apache2 locations\n  ansible.sites.templates.template:\n    src: location.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ apache_modules_config_dir }}/location_{{ item.key }}.conf"\n    mode: 0644\n  loop: "{{ httpd_locations | dict.items() }}"\n  notify: \n    - httpd_config\n    - httpd_restart\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T11:15:19.097017031Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 12346714534, 'load_duration': 102433619, 'prompt_eval_count': 349, 'prompt_eval_duration': 83871181, 'eval_count': 725, 'eval_duration': 12158945693, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--4d8f41ef-2bc0-44c7-9c48-0a87405fe5e4-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 349, 'output_tokens': 725, 'total_tokens': 1074}
